 every\nday. Retreat Timer's five bowls or your own mp3/wav. Bowls are armed as\nexact alarm-clock alarms and rung by a foreground service, so they sound\non time through Doze and silent mode. Home-screen widget (play/stop,\nminutes, countdown, progress) and a Reader's Launcher tile.\n"}, "preferredSigner": "9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"}, "versions": {"c435fcd443d99cd3c23cf364961a80cb57317a2fa248116b3a07d2f682fd2bef": {"added": 1789030921000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersMindful-v1.0.0.apk", "sha256": "c435fcd443d99cd3c23cf364961a80cb57317a2fa248116b3a07d2f682fd2bef", "size": 14769047}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.0.0", "versionCode": 1, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_EXACT_ALARM"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.VIBRATE"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.readersmindful.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "com.freedomfighter.readersrecorder": {"metadata": {"added": 1789038553000, "categories": ["Multimedia"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/funkypitt/readers-recorder/issues", "lastUpdated": 1789038553000, "license": "MIT", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/funkypitt/readers-recorder", "webSite": "https://github.com/funkypitt/readers-recorder", "authorName": "funkypitt", "name": {"en-US": "Reader's Recorder"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Black-and-white voice recorder; your own computer cleans and transcribes"}, "description": {"en-US": "Record a memo, a lecture or a conversation with one tap (list, widget,\nReader's Launcher tile). Nothing leaves the phone by default. Set up a\nWebDAV folder (kDrive, Nextcloud) in three questions and each recording\ngoes there, where a small worker on your own computer cleans the sound,\nnormalises its loudness and transcribes it with WhisperX; the transcript\nand the cleaned audio come back to the phone. Text only, white on black\nor black on white, six languages.\n"}, "preferredSigner": "9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"}, "versions": {"620e394e1c7aa7dfede9946c152e165d2a47bee6813979f0ec9ad3c1e3d307bf": {"added": 1789038553000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersRecorder-v1.0.0.apk", "sha256": "620e394e1c7aa7dfede9946c152e165d2a47bee6813979f0ec9ad3c1e3d307bf", "size": 7971239}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.0.0", "versionCode": 1, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MICROPHONE"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.VIBRATE"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.readersrecorder.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "com.freedomfighter.retreattimer": {"metadata": {"lastUpdated": 1789030921000}, "versions": {"337d16347d5eb7ca9b9d55c084f9c521ff9ca1da43c8981917ea3093332936e2": null, "9c719b58d90982f133dda8b324fa027aca9eac55c910f149680136707cce462e": {"added": 1789030921000, "file": {"name": "/RetreatTimer-v1.13.0.apk", "sha256": "9c719b58d90982f133dda8b324fa027aca9eac55c910f149680136707cce462e", "size": 23238637}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v